{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on question 718e0239 (DX-A1 c9d4e517: the published carrier of\nthe authoring skill).\n\nThe carrier is @generalbusiness/dap-platform, as recommended. It is\nalready public, and it holds the package validation and application\ncodecs an author's package meets. The head copies the canonical\nskills/dap-application tree into that package's external release stage,\nlists `skills` in its output files, hashes the tree, and verifies the\nactual archive in the evidence. The seven-package public set, its code\nexports, dependencies and the no-publication boundary stay as they are.\nNo public CLI release and no registry publication: the CLI stays\nprivate, and the skill's write, check, fix loop names `dap check` as run\nfrom the repository.\n\nThe repository installation path stays primary: the plugin marketplace\nentry and Codex's equivalent install the skill from the repository, and\nthe checked templates and installation manifests travel in the same\nhead.\n\nRequest c9d4e517 stands with \"the published CLI package\" read as\n\"the published @generalbusiness/dap-platform package\"; no refiling.\nRetire this question when you have read the ruling.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}